# Gate G3 (docs/expansion/PLAN.md 6.2: "every (arena, mode) bot test green"; the orchestrator's G3 task: "every versus
# mode on every arena with bots - windowed, screenshots looked at"): versus through the real UI on EVERY (arena, mode)
# cell CPUs play - title -> Play -> Versus -> the lobby (P1 presses Jump on the left keyboard half, P2 on the numpad;
# two CPU seats as Hunters) -> the rules (the mode; first to 1 round win) -> the arena select -> the round -> the
# results -> the lobby, cell after cell, then the title. A humans-only cell (G50, meta `bots`) is not offered with CPUs
# seated and is left out (Tar Pulleys). The humans press nothing during the rounds (their heroes read the keyboard
# halves); the Hunters are core-B's HeroBots on DA's graphs. Screenshots: rules, arena card, intro, every 480 ticks,
# results of every cell. Generated by build/g3i/gen_versus_flow.py from levels/arena_*.lvl (the arena select lists
# Random, the open arenas of the mode in file order, Party Mix; it opens on the match's arena). Owner: integration.
#   GD_TIMEOUT=5400 bash .tools/gd.sh play --flow=tools/autoplay/g3_versus.flow --fast --fresh-user --out=g3_versus
# --- Boot, title, Play > Versus, seats -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
wait_until flow.current_screen == title 600
wait_until flow.busy == false 600
wait 40
press ui_accept
wait 10
press ui_down
press ui_down
wait 6
press ui_accept
wait_until flow.current_screen == versus_lobby 300
wait_until flow.busy == false 600
wait 10
key Space
key Kp_0
wait 10
expect game.versus_match.get_seat(0).kind == 1
expect game.versus_match.get_seat(1).kind == 1
# The focus starts on START: Up = Teams, Up = card 1, Right twice = the free card 3; confirm on a free card adds a
# Hunter; Right = card 4, confirm = a second Hunter; a card's Up = START.
press ui_up
press ui_up
press ui_right
press ui_right
press ui_accept
wait 4
press ui_right
press ui_accept
wait 10
expect game.versus_match.player_count() == 4
expect game.versus_match.is_bot(2) == true
expect game.versus_match.is_bot(3) == true
press ui_up
wait 6
shot lobby_two_hunters

# --- Cell 1: Grub Stack on cinder_pit ------------------------------------------------------------
hold Ctrl Kp_Enter
wait_until game.versus_match.can_start() == true 600
release all
wait 10
press ui_accept
wait_until flow.current_screen == versus_rules 300
wait_until flow.busy == false 600
wait 10
expect game.versus_match.mode == 0
# Down twice = Rounds; Right = first to 1 round win (a short match per cell); back up to the Mode row.
press ui_down
press ui_down
press ui_right
wait 4
expect game.versus_match.rounds_to_win == 1
press ui_up
press ui_up
wait 6
shot rules_grub_stack_cinder_pit
# Up from the Mode row: "Choose the arena".
press ui_up
press ui_accept
wait_until flow.current_screen == versus_arena 300
wait_until flow.busy == false 600
wait 10
press ui_right
wait 4
expect game.versus_match.arena == arena_cinder_pit
shot arena_grub_stack_cinder_pit
press ui_accept
wait_until flow.current_screen == level 900
wait_until flow.busy == false 600
wait_until level.level_id == arena_cinder_pit 600
expect game.mode == 2
expect level.hero_count() == 4
input device
wait 2
shot grub_stack_cinder_pit_intro
every 480 grub_stack_cinder_pit
wait_until flow.current_screen == versus_results 30000
every 0
wait_until flow.busy == false 600
wait 90
shot results_grub_stack_cinder_pit
expect game.versus_match.is_over() == true
expect game.versus_match.mode == 0

